Bind Npc 18004 Zone 21
Quest 1208 "Kaishan's trust"
    Journal "Defeat the monsters in Moradon and bring 20 Apples of Moradon"
    Collect 1 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 4

Rewards
    Give 1 of 900604000

On available
    Say "Master! Kaishan is looking for you!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Recently I've heard that you are doing good deeds so I've come to ask you a favor."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Apple of Moradon can be found by defeating monsters near Moradon. Many are looking for this so that they can see what can come out of it. <selfname> could you help us?"

On in_progress
    Say "Still not done? Collecting 1  Apple of Moradon seem harder than I imagined."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have collected them all! Thank you. While you were collecting the Apples of Moradon, Potrang has came by. I'll give you a certificate now."
